<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Molinos 9-mth net $21.6 million.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Molinos 9-mth net $21.6 million.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $21.6 million vs n/a. NOTE: the company did not provide comparisons, revenues or earnings per share for the period, or third quarter results. It reported a net worth of $335.2 million and retained earnings of $86.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
